{"id":"mente","lemma":"mente","pos":"noun","rank":520,"glosses":["mind, intellect"],"ipa":"/ˈmente/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mentes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy de mente abierta.","en":"I'm open-minded.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441937"},{"text":"Yo puedo leer mentes.","en":"I can read minds."},{"text":"Me lees la mente.","en":"You read my mind.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443950"},{"text":"Quería poder leer mentes.","en":"I wanted to be able to read minds."},{"text":"Tiene algo en mente.","en":"He's up to something.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1195990"}]}